{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":22,"code":"SNG","name":"Song of Songs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":7,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"SNG 7:1"},"How beautiful are thy feet with shoes, O prince’s daughter! the joints of thy thighs ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," like jewels, the work of the hands of a cunning workman. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"SNG 7:2"},"Thy navel ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is like"]}," a round goblet, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," wanteth not liquor: thy belly ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is like"]}," an heap of wheat set about with lilies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"SNG 7:3"},"Thy two breasts ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," like two young roes ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that are "]},"twins. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"SNG 7:4"},"Thy neck ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as a tower of ivory; thine eyes ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["like "]},"the fishpools in Heshbon, by the gate of Bath-rabbim: thy nose ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as the tower of Lebanon which looketh toward Damascus. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"SNG 7:5"},"Thine head upon thee ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," like Carmel, and the hair of thine head like purple; the king ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," held in the galleries. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"SNG 7:6"},"How fair and how pleasant art thou, O love, for delights! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"SNG 7:7"},"This thy stature is like to a palm tree, and thy breasts to clusters ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["of grapes. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"SNG 7:8"},"I said, I will go up to the palm tree, I will take hold of the boughs thereof: now also thy breasts shall be as clusters of the vine, and the smell of thy nose like apples; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"SNG 7:9"},"And the roof of thy mouth like the best wine for my beloved, that goeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["down"]}," sweetly, causing the lips of those that are asleep to speak. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"SNG 7:10"},"I ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["am"]}," my beloved’s, and his desire ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," toward me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"SNG 7:11"},"Come, my beloved, let us go forth into the field; let us lodge in the villages. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"SNG 7:12"},"Let us get up early to the vineyards; let us see if the vine flourish, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["whether"]}," the tender grape appear, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["and"]}," the pomegranates bud forth: there will I give thee my loves. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"SNG 7:13"},"The mandrakes give a smell, and at our gates ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," all manner of pleasant ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["fruits,"]}," new and old, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," I have laid up for thee, O my beloved. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"SNG 7:13"}]}]}
